| Revenue Growth          | Line Graph        |
| Case Study              | Caselet           |

Do not use a visual merely because it is available. Choose the visual that best communicates the data.

---

# VISUAL QUALITY RULES

Every generated visual must satisfy all of the following.

* Clean.
* Minimal.
* Easy to read.
* Properly labeled.
* Bilingual.
* Realistic.
* Consistent.
* Logically correct.
* Numerically accurate.

Avoid:

